{"id":"n53962-4-4","stage":4,"title":"뜨이다 · 竖起耳朵","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53962-4-4-1","ko":"아들아, 여기 특별 용돈이다.","zh":"儿子，给你额外的零花钱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아들아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"특별","meaning":"特别、额外（这里指额外的零花钱）","explanation":"특별：特别、额外（这里指额外的零花钱）","readings":[{"term":"특별","audio":"/audio/d1dda53fe376988b83dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49420","senseId":"1","lemma":"특별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"용돈이다.","meaning":"零花钱，零用钱","explanation":"용돈：零花钱，零用钱；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"용돈","audio":"/audio/07c35f2a6c1c1bdf46f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67869","senseId":"1","lemma":"용돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"要和别人搭话或引起注意时先发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"d1dda53fe376988b","term":"특별","zh":"特别、额外（这里指额外的零花钱）","audio":"/audio/d1dda53fe376988b83dd.mp3","entryId":"49420","definition":"特别、额外（这里指额外的零花钱）","pronunciation":["특뼐"]},{"id":"07c35f2a6c1c1bdf","term":"용돈","zh":"零花钱，零用钱","audio":"/audio/07c35f2a6c1c1bdf46f2.mp3","entryId":"67869","definition":"个人可以用于多种用途自由支配的钱。","pronunciation":["용ː똔"]}],"audio":"/audio/b400885e090839b58ae6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53962-4-4-2","ko":"정말요? 귀가 다 뜨이네요. 어머니, 고마워요.","zh":"真的？一听这话我就来精神了！谢谢妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말요?","meaning":"真是的","explanation":"정말：真是的；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61175","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀가","meaning":"听觉能力","explanation":"귀：听觉能力；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"귀","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60201","senseId":"8","lemma":"귀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜨이네요.","meaning":"竖起耳朵","explanation":"뜨이다：竖起耳朵；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"뜨이다","audio":"/audio/4cd8156c5e31206162f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53962","senseId":"4","lemma":"뜨이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워요.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真是的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61175","definition":"用于表示惊讶或严肃看待某件事情。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"001e793a4472c6fe","term":"귀","zh":"听觉能力","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3","entryId":"60201","definition":"欣赏某种声音或语言的能力。","pronunciation":["귀"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"4cd8156c5e312061","term":"뜨이다","zh":"竖起耳朵","audio":"/audio/4cd8156c5e31206162f6.mp3","entryId":"53962","definition":"听到期待以外的消息而生出强烈的好奇心。","pronunciation":["뜨이다"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/44fcaa2ccb4d52be5d58.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.233,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53962","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.0597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的？一听这话我就来精神了！谢谢妈妈。","加入空军感觉怎么样？","儿子，给你额外的零花钱。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的？一听这话我就来精神了！谢谢妈妈。","儿子，给你额外的零花钱。","加入空军感觉怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
